This repository includes an optional LoRA adapter for BERTimbau Large and a
copy of its tokenizer files. BERTimbau is available from:

  https://huggingface.co/neuralmind/bert-large-portuguese-cased
  https://github.com/neuralmind-ai/portuguese-bert

The adapter records base-model revision
aa302f6ea73b759f7df9cad58bd272127b67ec28. The adapter distribution does not
contain the BERTimbau base-model weights; they must be obtained separately.

